{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is not a hero\u2019s tale \u2014 it is a record of observed history.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/06e34fef66789fed089ce0be95bd0d69.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The End of History</i> is a <strong>sandbox strategy RPG</strong> set in a medieval-inspired world.<br>In this world, <strong>NPCs live with their own wills and goals, just as the player does.</strong>As their intertwined causes and consequences unfold, countless events are etched into history, allowing you to experience a story that is truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you leave your foster parent behind and set out into the world as a nameless wanderer.<br>In a world where countless NPC ambitions collide\u2014alliances form and betrayals spread\u2014you too must live on as one who helps shape history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prevent the Collapse of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/f2586b1907c93b6969a2243acfa2e04b.avif?t=1766741303\" width=522 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given a single mission: <strong>to stop the collapse of the world.</strong>As hatred and division accumulate, the world moves steadily toward ruin.<br>Every action influences history, and its ripples will eventually return as far-reaching consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Freely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/281aedc8f247dc0dd8407d659e6f9c9c.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1560 height=865 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as an unknown drifter, with paths leading to bandit, merchant, knight, or even king.<br>Both NPCs and the player possess their own ambitions and daily lives, and <strong>how you choose to live is entirely up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you may be given unreasonable orders or forced into unfair situations.<br>However, <strong>how you confront them\u2014or whether you choose to ignore them altogether\u2014is also your decision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These accumulated choices shape the world and give form to your own history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery of the \u201cObelisk\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/4b09dbe4a81906f47264c32019a11fcc.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1560 height=806 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of clues are scattered across the world.<br>What is the true nature of the massive structure known as the <strong>Obelisk</strong>, said to contain infinite knowledge?<br>Discover for yourself how it is connected to a world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Where Unique Histories Are Born</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/243ce821566a89cc94cb2f7fe251066f.avif?t=1766741303\" width=702 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/11191d4d0b3f097d596df7a65d4da295.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1169 height=758 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no predetermined scenario in this game.<br>Instead, a <strong>\u201chistory that is observed\u201d</strong> emerges from the outcomes of countless events, becoming your personal story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small decisions, casual conversations, and the aftermath of battles<br>can sway the emotions of both NPCs and the player, alter their actions,<br>and ultimately drive major shifts in the world\u2019s state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/576e9e4c2b1ae860d84449e652591615.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1347 height=932 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs live, fight, build relationships, and sometimes perish even beyond your sight.<br>Yet your actions can still leave a lasting impact on their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These accumulated moments become a <strong>one-of-a-kind history that only you can observe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended for Players Who\u2026 (For me)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has very clear characteristics, so we want to be upfront about who will enjoy it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly recommended if you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>deep role-playing that emphasizes immersion in the narrative</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can appreciate events that do not go your way as <strong>part of the story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love <strong>simulations where history and NPC lives evolve dynamically</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unlock All Achievements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/159de95e298fcbffaea1c2f950ab4fad04bd0fb8.jpg"},{"name":"World Collapse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/30a2b72f4ebaf29d4fcacc6332d990deaaecb567.jpg"},{"name":"World Conquest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/1cf39c306a25263a6ce541408367d96e9e1a69dd.jpg"},{"name":"Millennium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/6ddb938af0d9d306657ee57809bd00e4a7fa6d57.jpg"},{"name":"Slay Roxelana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/7fbf15c8f86a10aeb633f2a036888b646fce788f.jpg"},{"name":"Vixen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/212287eb8976f526b6009639841c9d260b69b0e9.jpg"},{"name":"Journey's Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/0e3e12f54b1d3bf846cfb5bbcca4d6f29e343be8.jpg"},{"name":"Debut Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/b8108e795f490972568d93bd1c3c25ba7d1ce874.jpg"},{"name":"Observe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/7c44615af0a5dc729434be0ec6f1e646f5058a1c.jpg"},{"name":"Exhaustion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2953520/37af04efdad4c9004dd54044b615f6fd234567c3.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953520?t=1766741303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766741303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/c2d3e21e272008cb8060915d69c887b88281804f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766741303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/c2d3e21e272008cb8060915d69c887b88281804f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766741303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4004750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>If you're thinking about buying The End of History</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The End of History</i> has some very unique systems, so we recommend giving the free demo a try before you decide to purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can replay the first two in-game years of Campaign Mode under the same rules and features as the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo save data can be carried over to the full game as well. Have fun!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is not a hero\u2019s tale \u2014 it is a record of observed history.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/06e34fef66789fed089ce0be95bd0d69.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The End of History</i> is a <strong>sandbox strategy RPG</strong> set in a medieval-inspired world.<br>In this world, <strong>NPCs live with their own wills and goals, just as the player does.</strong>As their intertwined causes and consequences unfold, countless events are etched into history, allowing you to experience a story that is truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you leave your foster parent behind and set out into the world as a nameless wanderer.<br>In a world where countless NPC ambitions collide\u2014alliances form and betrayals spread\u2014you too must live on as one who helps shape history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prevent the Collapse of the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/f2586b1907c93b6969a2243acfa2e04b.avif?t=1766741303\" width=522 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given a single mission: <strong>to stop the collapse of the world.</strong>As hatred and division accumulate, the world moves steadily toward ruin.<br>Every action influences history, and its ripples will eventually return as far-reaching consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Freely</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/281aedc8f247dc0dd8407d659e6f9c9c.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1560 height=865 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin as an unknown drifter, with paths leading to bandit, merchant, knight, or even king.<br>Both NPCs and the player possess their own ambitions and daily lives, and <strong>how you choose to live is entirely up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you may be given unreasonable orders or forced into unfair situations.<br>However, <strong>how you confront them\u2014or whether you choose to ignore them altogether\u2014is also your decision.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These accumulated choices shape the world and give form to your own history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery of the \u201cObelisk\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/4b09dbe4a81906f47264c32019a11fcc.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1560 height=806 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of clues are scattered across the world.<br>What is the true nature of the massive structure known as the <strong>Obelisk</strong>, said to contain infinite knowledge?<br>Discover for yourself how it is connected to a world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Where Unique Histories Are Born</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/243ce821566a89cc94cb2f7fe251066f.avif?t=1766741303\" width=702 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/11191d4d0b3f097d596df7a65d4da295.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1169 height=758 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no predetermined scenario in this game.<br>Instead, a <strong>\u201chistory that is observed\u201d</strong> emerges from the outcomes of countless events, becoming your personal story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small decisions, casual conversations, and the aftermath of battles<br>can sway the emotions of both NPCs and the player, alter their actions,<br>and ultimately drive major shifts in the world\u2019s state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/576e9e4c2b1ae860d84449e652591615.avif?t=1766741303\" width=1347 height=932 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs live, fight, build relationships, and sometimes perish even beyond your sight.<br>Yet your actions can still leave a lasting impact on their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These accumulated moments become a <strong>one-of-a-kind history that only you can observe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended for Players Who\u2026 (For me)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has very clear characteristics, so we want to be upfront about who will enjoy it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly recommended if you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>deep role-playing that emphasizes immersion in the narrative</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can appreciate events that do not go your way as <strong>part of the story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love <strong>simulations where history and NPC lives evolve dynamically</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tatamibeya"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/726bba7d0c9f69354c3167fa4464fb6a4b2f45cf/header.jpg?t=1766741303","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Tatamibeya All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953520/290891964/6c0bfe2782a8c5e4e1341408fbb3ad58b9c5989f/1751880611/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752189850","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953520/290891964/6c0bfe2782a8c5e4e1341408fbb3ad58b9c5989f/1751880611/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752189850","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953520/290891964/6c0bfe2782a8c5e4e1341408fbb3ad58b9c5989f/1751880611/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752189850","id":257166048,"name":"Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a